---
/*
 * Identity resolution as a graph, which is the one idea in this case study that
 * prose cannot carry: record 1 and record 2 share a phone, record 2 and record 3
 * share an email, so all three are one person even though 1 and 3 have nothing
 * in common. Union-Find collapses the component to one representative.
 *
 * Records are numbered, never named, and no source system appears: the
 * anonymisation rule holds inside the diagram as much as it does in the copy.
 *
 * Shared canvas and styling: the .diagram rules in src/styles/global.css.
 */
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <div class="diagram-scroll">
    <svg
      viewBox="-8 -10 596 208"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="idgraph-title idgraph-desc"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
      <title id="idgraph-title">Three customer records resolved to one golden ID</title>
      <desc id="idgraph-desc">
        Record 1 and record 2 are joined by a shared name and phone number. Record 2 and record 3 are
        joined by a shared name and email address. Records 1 and 3 share nothing directly. Connected
        components collapses all three into a single golden ID.
      </desc>

      <g class="edge-label">
        <text x="0" y="0">one person, three rows, no shared key</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Edges first, so the node fills cover the line ends. -->
      <g class="edge">
        <line x1="72" y1="76" x2="184" y2="150" />
        <line x1="184" y1="150" x2="296" y2="76" />
      </g>

      <!-- No edge between 1 and 3. That is the whole point, so absence is drawn. -->
      <g class="edge is-absent">
        <line x1="81" y1="76" x2="287" y2="76" />
      </g>

      <g class="node">
        <circle cx="72" cy="76" r="9" />
        <circle cx="184" cy="150" r="9" />
        <circle cx="296" cy="76" r="9" />
      </g>

      <g class="node-label">
        <text x="72" y="48" text-anchor="middle">record 1</text>
        <text x="296" y="48" text-anchor="middle">record 3</text>
        <text x="184" y="180" text-anchor="middle">record 2</text>
      </g>

      <g class="edge-label">
        <text x="184" y="68" text-anchor="middle">nothing in common</text>
        <text x="112" y="122" text-anchor="end">name + phone</text>
        <text x="256" y="122">name + email</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Union-Find collapses the component to one stable representative. -->
      <g class="collapse">
        <line x1="360" y1="113" x2="430" y2="113" />
        <polygon points="430,107 444,113 430,119" />
        <text x="395" y="101" text-anchor="middle">union-find</text>
      </g>

      <g class="accent">
        <circle cx="504" cy="113" r="17" />
        <text x="504" y="152" text-anchor="middle">one golden ID</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption>Three rows, two shared attributes, one golden ID.</figcaption>
</figure>
